# Two layers live in this repo:
#   lowercase dirs (docs/, templates/, scripts/, examples/) = the kit, tracked
#   Capitalized dirs at the root = your personal job hunt, never tracked
#
# Personal patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED (leading slash) on purpose, so
# examples/Context/, examples/Resumes/, and examples/Applications/ stay tracked.

# --- Personal working layout (created by scripts/setup.sh) ---
/Context/
/Resumes/
/CoverLetters/
/Applications/
/Prep/
/Research/

# --- Secrets, anywhere in the tree ---
# Matches only files named exactly Credentials.md. templates/Credentials.template.md
# is tracked on purpose (headings and field names only, no values), and no
# pattern below matches it.
Credentials.md
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json

# --- Stray personal files dropped at the root ---
# Browser screenshots land here by default, and so does a resume you hand in
# during setup. Keep originals in Resumes/Archive/ instead.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.pdf
/*.doc
/*.docx

# --- Rendered output next to the kit templates (templates are copied, never filled in place) ---
/templates/**/*.pdf

# --- Tool output ---
.playwright-mcp/
node_modules/
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- OS and editor junk ---
.DS_Store
~$*
